8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">My speculative prediction for the future of the S&amp;P 500. Not drawn to scale, illustrative purposes only. </figcaption></figure></div><p>Now even though we have tons of evidence to support a massive downward collapse…the part I didn’t know was the “WHY”. You can have utterly terrible economic conditions…yet markets go up. For example, millions were unemployed and small businesses were shut down in the COVID pandemic….yet the stock market was having a party upwards! We needed<strong> a catalyst</strong>…a black-swan event (which is unpredictable in itself). I never knew the “when” or the “why”. And before you ask: “So why do you make those posts?” Answer: The people in 1927 would have loved a heads up in 1929. Though I imagine anyone making those predictions in 1927 would likely have gotten spit on, just like I often do on TikTok. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZSbi!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fde8b82dc-cb4a-4318-93db-a220d16fdca4_1139x594.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZSbi!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fde8b82dc-cb4a-4318-93db-a220d16fdca4_1139x594.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZSbi!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fde8b82dc-cb4a-4318-93db-a220d16fdca4_1139x594.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZSbi!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fde8b82dc-cb4a-4318-93db-a220d16fdca4_1139x594.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZSbi!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fde8b82dc-cb4a-4318-93db-a220d16fdca4_1139x594.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZSbi!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fde8b82dc-cb4a-4318-93db-a220d16fdca4_1139x594.png\" width=\"1139\" height=\"594\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/de8b82dc-cb4a-4318-93db-a220d16fdca4_1139x594.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:594,&quot;width&quot;:1139,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:148092,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/167099846?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fde8b82dc-cb4a-4318-93db-a220d16fdca4_1139x594.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZSbi!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fde8b82dc-cb4a-4318-93db-a220d16fdca4_1139x594.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZSbi!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fde8b82dc-cb4a-4318-93db-a220d16fdca4_1139x594.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZSbi!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fde8b82dc-cb4a-4318-93db-a220d16fdca4_1139x594.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ZSbi!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fde8b82dc-cb4a-4318-93db-a220d16fdca4_1139x594.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">I can’t imagine going through life woefully ignorant. Educated guessers will always outperform uneducated guessers.</figcaption></figure></div><p>I recently came across this YouTube channel “<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@PredictiveHistory/videos\">Predictive History</a>”. His video from May 2024, recently went semi-viral, with 1.3M views. As a creator, I’d say this is still not widely known. Now, get your mind oriented for May of 2024…you are sitting in his class. <strong>At that point in time</strong>, if you had heard “Trump will be president”…\"Trump will get a 3rd term”… “The U.S. will be baited to drop bombs on Iran”…you would have sat their dumbfounded at the predictions…thinking the guy was a clown show 🤡. Fast forward to today…and personally I consider him a genius. He has a plethora of accurate predictions, some of which are WILD for May 2024. </p><p>When you have an hour of time on your hands…maybe a long drive, or you are doing some mundane task to listen in, I recommend listing to his class “<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7y_hbz6loEo\">Geo-Strategy #8: The Iran Trap</a>”. I’ll confess, its not the most exhilarating content of your life, but worth a listen. He has made some recent updates as well. Particularly he discusses the advancement of WW3; the “mission creep” of how we send troops to Iran and how we even advance to civil war. Civil war is not how you imagine it from history books…but more so constant pop-ups across America. </p><p><strong>The primary point being</strong>: considering his incredibly accurate \"predictive history”…I do hold his future predictions as relevant in the back of my mind. And what better catalyst for a -80% drop than WW3 and Civil War within the United States?!</p><p><strong>Again, I reiterate, do not sprint to sell off positions (NFA, you do you). Enjoy your weekend as if nothing is going on, to maintain sanity. 👉 We are in a bull market! 👈 </strong>So many people only look at their stocks and see only a line going up…those are the same people who consistently get caught in massive market downturns. It’s why we consistently see, even long term investors, returning to the workforce in droves. I cannot tell you how many people I have seen…THOUSANDS…who make a huge profit, only to lose it all…because of their “positivity bias”. Consider the NEGATIVE elements in our world, their potential impact, and protect yourself…for whenever they may happen. </p><div><hr></div><p><em>For more: <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em> <em><strong>| <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing for Beginners</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/timothys-stocktok-tracker?r=4z8lgl\">Current Stock Positions</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-daily-update?r=4z8lgl\">Daily Stock Screener</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a></strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to the Stock Screener. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><div class=\"captioned-button-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/friday-week-close-highlights?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=share&amp;action=share&amp;token=eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjozMDEwNTIzMjUsInBvc3RfaWQiOjE2Njk2NDk0OCwiaWF0IjoxNzUxMjA1MDcyLCJleHAiOjE3NTM3OTcwNzIsImlzcyI6InB1Yi0zNTM3ODIyIiwic3ViIjoicG9zdC1yZWFjdGlvbiJ9.XdpoHQxL7JpjBNDNBn-1dXVMyY74744-RUKI_b_p02U&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CaptionedButtonToDOM\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Think someone else would like to hear both sides of the story to the stock market? Consider sharing with someone you know.</p></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-80-stock-market-crash-the-why?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-80-stock-market-crash-the-why?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p></div>",
